WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And finally, thanks to
newly developed technology,

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
we here at "Late Night"
now have --

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:04.871 size:81% position:41% line:92%
this is very exciting.

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:08.074 size:88% position:44%
We now have the ability
to record the tiny voice

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:10.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is inside
Donald Trump's head.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you might be surprised
to know that like

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.246 size:84% position:42% line:92%
everyone's inner voice,

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:17.484
Donald Trump's is filled with
paralyzing fear and self-doubt.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.119 line:92%
So here it is, the tiny voice

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the back
of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.590 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
-Hey, Donald,

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's the tiny voice
in your head again.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.764 size:75% position:38%
And are you thinking
what I'm thinking?

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:34.968
Because it really seems like
your wife doesn't love you.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.302 line:92%
You know why I think that?

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because people who are in love
do not scowl

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:40.774 line:92%
for all 24 hours of the day.

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:42.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
These people taking pictures
are going to crack

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.813
their iPhone screens with how
angry she looks all the time.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:50.450
Hey, what was the last real
conversation you two had anyway?

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because the last thing
I remember

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
is election night when
she turned to you and said,

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.122 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"Are you happy now?"

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.357 line:92%
-And that's why I'm here today.

00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:00.060
-Hey, by the way, who is
this guy talking right now?

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:04.531
And who is this woman who is
standing next to your wife?

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:06.099 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What is going on?

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:08.668
You have no idea
where you are right now, do you?

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.904 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No idea at all.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.872 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, boy.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.141 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

